From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@localhost>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] add --xjack-word for weighted slot substitution in source

Extends --xjack-source with slot markers {name} that are replaced by
weighted random word choices at each sentence boundary via --xjack-word.
Multiple slot defs can be passed in one --xjack-word separated by |.

Example: swaylock --effect xjack \
  --xjack-source "All {verb} and no play makes Jack a dull boy.  " \
  --xjack-word "verb:work=5,code=3,tinker=2"

